<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1071359775"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:39.089"><div begin="27.733" end="52.880" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="27.733" end="33.425" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.733" end="29.516">窗透初晓</span> <span begin="29.516" end="31.212">日照西桥</span> <span begin="31.212" end="32.765">云自</span><span begin="32.765" end="33.425">摇</span></p><p begin="33.628" end="39.750" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.628" end="34.525">想你</span><span begin="34.525" end="35.336">当年</span><span begin="35.336" end="36.073">荷风</span><span begin="36.073" end="37.014">微摆</span><span begin="37.014" end="37.665">的衣</span><span begin="37.665" end="39.750">角</span></p><p begin="41.040" end="46.763" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.040" end="42.643">木雕流金</span> <span begin="42.643" end="44.320">岁月涟漪</span> <span begin="44.320" end="45.583">七年前</span><span begin="45.583" end="46.037">封</span><span begin="46.037" end="46.763">笔</span></p><p begin="47.295" end="52.880" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.295" end="47.618">因</span><span begin="47.618" end="48.496">为我</span><span begin="48.496" end="49.301">今生</span><span begin="49.301" end="50.152">挥毫</span><span begin="50.152" end="50.799">只为</span><span begin="50.799" end="52.880">你</span></p></div><div begin="54.323" end="1:06.295" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="54.323" end="1:00.372" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.323" end="54.857">雨打</span><span begin="54.857" end="55.513">湿了</span><span begin="55.513" end="55.973">眼</span><span begin="55.973" end="56.624">眶</span> <span begin="56.827" end="57.613">年年</span><span begin="57.613" end="58.459">倚井</span><span begin="58.459" end="59.322">盼归</span><span begin="59.322" end="1:00.372">堂</span></p><p begin="1:00.918" end="1:06.295" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.918" end="1:01.827">最怕</span><span begin="1:01.827" end="1:02.618">不觉</span><span begin="1:02.618" end="1:03.380">泪